{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wgc-e-8-e4","title":"会白艾不轨文王将西悌复谏","order":5827,"accounts":[{"id":"wgc-a-8-e4","label":"正文","text":"会白艾不轨文王将西悌复谏","evidence":["wgc-q0513","wgc-q0085"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wgc-p0056","role":"复言但可敕会取艾不足自行","evidence":["wgc-q0513","wgc-q0085"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0045","role":"将西行并听邵悌劝阻","evidence":["wgc-q0513","wgc-q0085"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原纪年逐项对读；不从邻段继承绝对年份。","evidence":["wgc-q0513","wgc-q0085"]},"ordering_evidence":"wgc-q0513"}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0045","name":"司马昭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wgc-p0056","name":"邵悌","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wgc-q0085","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-0b9429010b4ab5a9ea4f","layer":"original","quote":"及会白邓艾不轨，文王将西，悌复曰：“钟会所统，五六倍于邓艾；但可敕会取艾，不足自行。”文王曰：“卿忘前时所言邪？而更云可不须行乎！虽尔，此言不可宣也。我要自当以信义待人〖14〗，但人不当负我，我岂可先人生心哉！近日贾护军问我〖15〗，言：‘颇疑钟会不？’我答言：‘如今遣卿行，宁可复疑卿邪？’贾亦无以易我语也〖16〗。我到长安，则自了矣。”军至长安，会果已死，咸如所策。﹝三﹞","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":598,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":188,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0513","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-0b9429010b4ab5a9ea4f","layer":"original","quote":"及会白邓艾不轨，文王将西，悌复曰：“钟会所统，五六倍于邓艾；但可敕会取艾，不足自行","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":598,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
